0..66 Comment "//! `tactics-over-goals` models tactic splices in value positions."
67..70 Comment "//!"
71..140 Comment "//! `assumption` returns the innermost binder whose type is the goal."
141..219 Comment "//! `intro` builds a function from a tactic answer under an introduced binder."
220..296 Comment "//! The pathological twin refuses a missing answer, a wrong goal, an untyped"
297..353 Comment "//! splice, an unknown tactic, and a computation splice."
354..357 Comment "//!"
358..431 Comment "//! The checker runs each tactic, checks its answer against the goal, and"
432..453 Comment "//! fills the splice."
454..500 Comment "//! The kernel replays the filled declaration."
501..536 Comment "//! So the kernel trusts no tactic."
537..540 Comment "//!"
541..557 Comment "//! - see: #2762"
